white|Colour adjective and colour noun retain distinct source ordinals; no racial sense or person identity is inferred. Curtain and paint examples translate colours and objects faithfully; countability is qualified.
actual|Real versus estimated cost is intended, not the false-friend meaning current. Lower comparison is preserved in Vietnamese and no temporal restriction or verified measurement is asserted.
hopeful|Experiencer hope and externally promising signs are source-supported boundaries. Applicants' places and trial progress both retain uncertainty; the latter does not imply proven scientific or medical success.
mental|Mind-related effort not pathology is the boundary. Puzzle example and Vietnamese trí óc fit adjective evidence; note avoids labelling a person or making a diagnostic claim.
responsibility|Assigned duty and accountability for an action are distinct proposals without force-splitting by tense. Only duty claims the Oxford ordinal; wrong document and acceptance translate faithfully, with for plus ing construction checked.
